Headscale Monitor for Home Assistant

The integration was developed with reference to Home Assistant Core's Tailscale integration (https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/2026.7.4/homeassistant/components/tailscale), distributed by Home Assistant contributors under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Configuration-flow and entity/coordinator patterns were consulted and adapted for the Headscale API. This project is independently maintained and is not an official Home Assistant project.

Headscale's API schema was consulted at https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/blob/v0.29.4/proto/headscale/v1/node.proto.

The project was created by Markus (teddybaerd) with assistance from OpenAI's ChatGPT (Codex), including research, code generation and documentation.
